    "message": "Integrate authenticated TuranSec engineering candidate and executable release gates\n\nCombine the reviewed backend, endpoint, React SOC and SQL work into one runnable candidate. Add restricted database roles, transactional mTLS authorization, wall-clock lease migration and startup capability checks. Pin exact-head CI; add host evidence, unsigned staging, signature verification, rollback tooling and installation guidance.\n\nRelease remains NO-GO pending exact-head GitHub execution, native Windows/Linux acceptance, original owner approvals, trusted signing and deployment authorization."
